  "name": "Necromancer: strongest ordinary/Greater buffs and exclusive Chill (#6086)",
  "contract": [
    "Foul Mandate 800199/573295-573298 and Greater 680286 grant stamina; level-58 rank5 and Greater grant",
    "54.",
    "Grim Mandate 572787-572789 and Greater 572790 grant flat spell power; rank 3 grants49 and Greater",
    "62.",
    "Chill of the Tomb 572173-572176 and Greater 572177 grant Frost resistance; rank 4 and Greater grant",
    "60.",
    "Razorice 500967/501960-501968 and Greater 572214 grant Frost damage shields; level-58 rank 7 and",
    "Greater grant 21.",
    "Native trainer 900023 offers roots at levels 12/38/26/8, Greater at 60/58/60/58, and the tested",
    "ordinary ranks at 58/52/50/58.",
    "Foul, Grim and Razorice pairs have matching additive effects but no spell-group relationship on",
    "frozen main c391c878db4a.",
    "Chill uses aura143, MOD_RESISTANCE_EXCLUSIVE: its native handler already keeps the highest",
    "resistance amount. It is a control and receives no new group.",
    "The strongest-buff contract is independently established by the shipped same-effect data and",
    "existing",
    "native Ranger Adaptation and Bloodmage Sanguinary Offering behavior. Each additive buff pair must",
    "retain one strongest",
    "buff per target, across casters, while buffs of different effects remain independent. A weaker cast",
    "must",
    "not downgrade a Greater buff. These are normally obtainable level-60 class spells initialized",
    "directly;",
    "Mana is refilled to 1000 for each cast to isolate stacking from resource exhaustion; native level-60",
    "Necromancer base mana 1373 makes the highest tested cost Greater Foul 69% (947). All tested",
    "applications are normal casts to grouped players. Stamina, spell power, Frost resistance and",
    "live aura amounts/presence are measured. This does not establish an exclusion between Foul and Grim",
    "Mandates, nor client icon rendering or bot rotation behavior."
  ],
